        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Design Hardware Grade 2 Cylindrical Lever</b>\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>\r\nFeatures:<br><br>\r\n*Heavy Duty independent springs for each lever<br>\r\n*Meets or exceeds ANSI 156.2 Standards<br>\r\n*Series 4000, Grade 2<br>\r\n*ASA 1 1/4\" x 4 7/8\" Strike standard<br>\r\n*Through bolted<br>\r\n*2 3/4\" BackSet Standard. <br>\r\n*2 3/8\" Backset available with 1\" x 2 1/4\" face<br>\r\n*Latches 2 3/4\" Standard with 2 1/4\"x1 1/8\" face<br>\r\n*All latches are UL listed 1/2\" Throw<br>\r\n*Six Pin solid brass C Keyway Standard<br>\r\n*Two nickel silver keys with each lock<br>\r\n*Non Handed<br>\r\n</b>\r\n<!--- <br>\r\n<b>Please <a href=\"http://www.designhardware.net/specs/xseries_spec_1.pdf\" target=\"popup\">click here</a> for more specifications regarding this item.</b><br> --->\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\nWhen choosing a function:\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyed Entry: Use when a keyed lock is needed.</li>\r\n<li>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom): For doors that could need locking.</li>\r\n<li>Passage (Hall or Closet): For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n<li>Dummy: For use as a pull or to match trim.</li>\r\n<li>Double Dummy: Stationary both sides of door</li>\r\n<li>Storeroom. Outside knob fixed. Entry by key only. Inside knob always unlocked. </li>\r\n<li>Classroom. Outside knob locked and unlocked by key. Inside knob always unlocked</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<b>*This item is discontinued.</b> \r\n<br>\r\nUse: <a href=\"/products/standard-commercial-leversets-global-gal-series\">Global  Standard Commercial Leversets</a>\r\n<br><br>\r\n</p>",
