                "description": "Design Hardware Grade 2 Cylindrical Lever\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n Heavy Duty independent springs for each lever\r\n\r\n Meets or exceeds ANSI 156.2 Standards\r\n\r\n Series 4000, Grade 2\r\n\r\n ASA 1 1/4 x 4 7/8 Strike standard\r\n\r\n Through bolted\r\n\r\n 2 3/4 BackSet Standard. \r\n\r\n 2 3/8 Backset available with 1 x 2 1/4 face\r\n\r\n Latches 2 3/4 Standard with 2 1/4x1 1/8 face\r\n\r\n All latches are UL listed 1/2 Throw\r\n\r\n Six Pin solid brass C Keyway Standard\r\n\r\n Two nickel silver keys with each lock\r\n\r\n Non Handed\r\n\r\nPlease ",
